This repository's workflows download and run third-party tools at pinned
versions (for example gitleaks, Semgrep, OSV-Scanner, Trivy, actionlint and
zizmor) and call third-party GitHub Actions pinned to commit SHAs. Those
tools and actions are not distributed with this product and remain under
their own licences.

The client applications under apps/ declare their npm dependencies in
apps/package-lock.json; those dependencies are installed at build time and
remain under their own licences.
